rces in turn releasing  the master builder  however the supreme commander of the  forerunner war efforts the iso didact  was able to use a control code to  temporarily stun the ai allowing the  capital's defenses to respond to the  attack  although they put up a valiant fight  against the sentinels and ships  defending the installations mendicant  bias was able to successfully activate  the ring's main weapon wiping out all  life on the capital world  following the battle at the capital  installation 7 activated a security  measure that was beyond the control of  the mintakin bias  this protocol was put in place to  prevent the facility from falling into  the wrong hands  it had been programmed to run on a  course that would result in a collision  with a planet with the automated control  systems having been sabotaged mendicant  bias was unable to change the course  using the humans and forerunners support  the installation they were sent to  various control stations across the halo  ring in an attempt to manually steer it  away from the planet  they were successful in changing the  orientation of the ring in a way where  the planet would pass through the centre  though installation 7 would take heavy  damage it would survive the encounter  as the ring passed over the planet's  gravitational pull began to bend and  distort the installation's outer walls  huge gaps started opening up some  hundreds of kilometers long  it was during this time that a fleet led  by the iso diadect appeared  he once again used his control codes to  shut down mindigan bias  using his fleet he was able to pump  extra power into the installation and  connect to the controls  the iso didact observed the massive  damage that had been taken and made the  call to shed large sections of the ring  and rebuild what could be saved  in the end two-thirds of the structure  was removed and discarded into  space installation seven now had a total  diameter of ten thousand kilometers  which also meant t